title: "Routing model: PM_SLACK_ROUTES JSON map + per-event channel override"
description: "Routing is an optional JSON env PM_SLACK_ROUTES mapping a selector (event name like 'block', or type like 'type:Bug', or 'status:blocked') to {webhook?,channel?}. First matching rule wins; falls back to PM_SLACK_WEBHOOK/PM_SLACK_CHANNEL. Keeps zero-config default identical. Pure function selectRoute() unit-tested."
